  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TCRB Expanding Access to Finance for Micro, Small, and Medium-Sized Enterprises Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The equity investment of the Asian Development Bank (ADB) in the TCRB will serve as growth capital, enabling the bank to expand its micro, small, and medium-sized enterprise (MSME), nanofinance, and microfinance businesses further. The investment will support the TCRB in reaching out to and serving underserved groups, fostering financial inclusion and economic development in Thailand.</narrative>
  </description>
